  $script:pos = $doc.Range($s, $s).Paragraphs.Item(1).Range.End; AddText $capText 'cap' }
AddText '6.11  Verification and Live Evidence on a Second Machine (22 October 2026)' 'h3'
AddText 'After the project was restored on a second Windows 11 laptop from the GitHub repository (models from Git LFS; images rebuilt: inference :9, frontend :4, operator :2), the complete system was started again and the claims of this report were re-checked. This section records the environment (Table 6.12), the 21-check validation suite (Table 6.13), an independent recomputation of the six contributions directly from the raw result files (Table 6.14), the completion of the golden-output (G4) cells of SilentBench to ten trials (Table 6.15) and live screenshots of the running system (Figures 6.18 to 6.36). Nothing in Sections 6.1 to 6.10 was changed except Table 6.2 (G4 now n = 10).' 'body'
AddText '6.11.1  Environment and validation suite' 'h5'
$env = @("Component`tVersion / role", "Operating system`tWindows 11 (25H2), WSL2 backend", "Docker Desktop`t29.9.1 (engine)", "Kubernetes`tv1.37.0 on minikube v1.39.0 (containerd 2.3.4), 4 CPUs, 5.5 GB", "kubectl / Helm / Git / Git LFS`t1.36 / 4.3.1 / 2.55 / 3.7.1", "Python and key libraries`t3.10.11; TensorFlow 2.15.1; Flask 2.3.3; pandas 2.0.3; statsmodels 0.14.0", "Container images`tclimate-inference:9, climate-frontend:4, climate-operator:2 (built from the repository)", "Monitoring`tPrometheus v3.15.0 (chart 29.37.0); Grafana 12.3.1 (chart 10.5.15), 16 dashboard panels", "Repository state`tcommit 3439355 plus the corrections listed in Section 6.11.4")
AddTable $env; AddText 'Table 6.12  Environment of the second-machine run' 'cap'
AddText 'The validation suite validation/validate_all.py was run unchanged against the freshly deployed cluster. All 21 checks passed (Table 6.13). Check V03 looks for the image tags climate-inference:4 and climate-frontend:2; these tags were created as aliases of the rebuilt images. The full report is stored in verification_2026-10-22/reports/.' 'body'
