$k = 18; foreach ($f in $figs) { AddPic $f[0] ("Figure 6.$k  " + $f[1]); $k++ }
AddText '6.11.4  Corrections found during verification' 'h5'
AddText 'During the second-machine run the following inconsistencies were found and corrected: the home page showed an obsolete CES formula (0.4, 0.3, 0.3) and algorithm list, which now read 0.6 x rainfall + 0.4 x temperature (humidity excluded) with the thresholds 1.051 and 1.300; the result page printed a blank humidity z-value, which now states that humidity is shown for reference only; the restore instructions lacked Flask; the number of validation checks (21) and dashboard panels (16) in this report were updated; and the references were completed from Crossref and arXiv. The LSTM result page deliberately keeps its own scale (Normal below 1, Moderate 1 to 2, Extreme above 2), which is implemented in its route and was not changed.' 'body'
